SS","id":"word-p-000361","images":[],"kind":"explanation","locator":"word/document.xml:p[361]","markers":[],"math":[{"display":"InlineMath","latex":"\\sqrt{5}"}],"mathStructures":[{"fractions":0,"radicals":1,"sha256":"fb455a6f95680c169b93c51ba3cecb87f3290998a990c7656c722e7a011309a2","superscripts":0}],"text":"先生　「まず  と3を比べます。どちらも正なので、2乗した値を比べて大小を判断できます。」"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000362","images":[],"kind":"question","locator":"word/document.xml:p[362]","markers":[5],"math":[{"display":"InlineMath","latex":"\\sqrt{5}"}],"mathStructures":[{"fractions":0,"radicals":1,"sha256":"fb455a6f95680c169b93c51ba3cecb87f3290998a990c7656c722e7a011309a2","superscripts":0}],"text":"【5】  と3の大小関係を、2乗した数の比較を添えて書こう。［　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　］"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000363","images":[],"kind":"question","locator":"word/document.xml:p[363]","markers":[6],"math":[{"display":"InlineMath","latex":"\\sqrt{5} - 3"}],"mathStructures":[{"fractions":0,"radicals":1,"sha256":"bb1e773482842e96999ffa5aa279745fb5f122743bd27358d939fbfd1578fd11","superscripts":0}],"text":"【6】 この結果から、 は正・0・負のどれか。　正 ／ 0 ／ 負"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000364","images":[],"kind":"question","locator":"word/document.xml:p[364]","markers":[7],"math":[],"mathStructures":[],"text":"【7】 絶対値を外し、最後に括弧も外した式を書こう。［　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　］"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000365","images":[],"kind":"explanation","locator":"word/document.xml:p[365]","markers":[],"math":[],"mathStructures":[],"text":"正負の判定と、括弧を外す計算は別の段階である。判定は数の大小から行い、その後に式全体をどう扱うか決める。"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000366","images":[],"kind":"explanation","locator":"word/document.xml:p[366]","markers":[],"math":[],"mathStructures":[],"text":"確認"},{"extractionStatus":"PASS","id":"word-p-000367","images":[],"kind":"explanation","locator":"word/document.xml:p[367]","markers":[],"math":[{"display":"InlineMath","latex":"\\text{|}3 - \\pi\\text{|}"},{"display":"InlineMath","latex":"\\pi = 3.14159\\ldots"}],"mathStructures